---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Daley Organics"
  description="Daley Organics Privacy Policy — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="https://daleyorganics.com/privacy"
>
  <div class="bg-[#141414] min-h-screen pt-[72px]">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="bg-[#0e0e0e] border-b border-white/10 py-14">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-white/60">Last updated: January 2025</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="container-custom py-16 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose-content space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">

        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Daley Organics collects, uses, and protects your information when you visit our website or contact us.</p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you fill out a contact form, request a quote, or communicate with us.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">This may include your name, email address, phone number, and the details of your message or order request.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We may also collect limited technical information (such as browser type, device information, and general usage patterns) to help maintain and improve the website.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2">
            <li>Respond to inquiries and provide customer support.</li>
            <li>Process and coordinate orders, pickups, or deliveries.</li>
            <li>Communicate about quotes, scheduling, and service updates.</li>
            <li>Improve the reliability, security, and usability of our website.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">3. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
          <p>Our website may use cookies or similar technologies to support core functionality (for example, maintaining session preferences) and to understand how the site is used.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain site features.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">4. Data Sharing</h2>
          <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited information with service providers only as necessary to operate the website or deliver services (for example, basic infrastructure or analytics), and only to the extent required.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">To make a request, please contact us using the details below. We may need to verify your request for security purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">6. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>We retain information for as long as needed to respond to requests, provide services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. Retention periods may vary depending on the context.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please reach out via our <a href="/#contact" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Contact page</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
